# fresh_res_objects_outside_task: Compute objects whose object-list entry names a record past the task's end: a compute pipeline, a sampler and a fence. No cursor can be made over the record (in each type's ResourceManager::new_object), so the command that names it fails and the exec faults. resources_record_outside_task does this for buffers, textures and heaps. A last exec dispatches the good kernel. A function past the end is a death instead (Metal's "computeFunction must not be nil", compute_death_function_*).
